{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026b3fwnBhH1S1795656772.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏措美縣的高原湖泊「古如拉措」因形似愛心，被譽為「愛心湖」，近年吸引不少遊客來欣賞「愛心」。</p><p></p><p>高原湖泊「古如拉措」沒有車輛直達，旅客要徒步約2.5公里才走到湖邊。這段路是從海拔4,200多米，爬升至4,700多米，但一見到「愛心湖」，似乎一切也值得。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XZ.LAKE.1118-1126.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026np4dCXN3PF1795656769.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>遊客稱︰「加油、加油，好累呀，終於到了。好美呀，太美啦。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XZ.LAKE.1118-1126_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LRVNw0eCKC1795656766.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>戶外徒步愛好者侯先生說︰「風光非常漂亮、特別美麗，但是它的海拔爬升有500米，往返距離差不多有五、六公里，對體能要求還是比較高的，希望大家能量力而行。」</p><p></p><p>景點員工達娃表示︰「『愛心湖』在網上越來越火，每天算人的話，有一百多人(次來打卡)。」</p><p></p><p>形似愛心的「古如拉措」被譽為「愛心湖」。當地旅遊配套日益完善，正創建國家3A級旅遊景區，為西藏旅遊注入新活力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.665688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.144647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:17.589683+00:00","content_hash":"8e093345319f85915abe6b1005ff76844da63a19b59fe681dd55b0b76be8d1f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.665688+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}